  "description": "Juice Hunter, Chil-Yong, and Koz have teamed up to bring our readers a series of unique omegaverse stories featuring a variety of leading male couples. Our couples include a dominant alpha/omega, a dominant omega/alpha, and a recessive alpha/dominant omega. Kicking off the series is “Mockingbird:” a story where our lead omega, Kei, has a gambling addiction that’s left him with nothing but debt. And just when he thought he couldn’t fall any deeper, Mei steps in and offers him a solution. \n\n(Source: Lezhin) \n\n**Release includes:**\n1. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 1\n2. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 2\n3. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 3\n4. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 4\n5. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 5\n6. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 6\n7. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 7\n8. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 8\n9. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 9\n10. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 10\n11. **Mockingbird** (모킹버드) by Koz 11\n12. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 1\n13. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 2\n14. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 3\n15. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 4\n16. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 5\n17. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 6\n18. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 7\n19. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 8\n20. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 9\n21. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 10\n22. **Simyageunmu** (심야근무; Midnight Job) by Juicy Hunter 11\n23. **Haeilcheoreom Millyeowa** (해일처럼 밀려와; Like a Tidal Wave) by Chil-Yong 1\n24. **Haeilcheoreom Millyeowa** (해일처럼 밀려와; Like a Tidal Wave) by Chil-Yong 2\n25. **Haeilcheoreom Millyeowa** (해일처럼 밀려와; Like a Tidal Wave) by Chil-Yong 3\n26. **Haeilcheoreom Millyeowa** (해일처럼 밀려와; Like a Tidal Wave) by Chil-Yong 4\n27. **Haeilcheoreom Millyeowa** (해일처럼 밀려와; Like a Tidal Wave) by Chi